 "no": 87,
 "title": "10.4 分式的乘除",
 "label": "八下·10.4",
 "part": "八下 第10章 分式",
 "url": "https://basic.smartedu.cn/tchMaterial/detail?contentType=assets_document&contentId=e2eb2248-6d8e-44fc-a1ef-a1eaead72992&catalogType=tchMaterial&subCatalog=tchMaterial",
 "paragraphs": [
  "分式的乘除运算法则",
  "怎样计算 $\\frac{1}{a} \\cdot \\frac{2}{a}$ 和 $\\frac{3}{a} \\div \\frac{2}{b}$？",
  "与分数乘法和除法的运算法则类似，分式乘法、除法的运算法则是：",
  "分式乘分式，用分子的积做积的分子，分母的积做积的分母；",
  "分式除以分式，把除式的分子、分母颠倒位置后，与被除式相乘。",
  "用符号表示为：$\\frac{b}{a} \\cdot \\frac{d}{c} = \\frac{bd}{ac}$； $\\frac{b}{a} \\div \\frac{d}{c} = \\frac{b}{a} \\cdot \\frac{c}{d} = \\frac{bc}{ad}$。",
  "例1",
  "计算：",
  "(1) $\\frac{4ac}{3b} \\cdot \\frac{9b^3}{2ac^2}$； (2) $\\frac{4ac}{3b} \\div \\frac{9b^3}{2ac^2}$。",
  "解",
  "(1) $\\frac{4ac}{3b} \\cdot \\frac{9b^3}{2ac^2} = \\frac{4ac \\cdot 9b^3}{3b \\cdot 2ac^2} = \\frac{36ab^3c}{6abc^2} = \\frac{6b^2}{c}$；",
  "(2) $\\frac{4ac}{3b} \\div \\frac{9b^3}{2ac^2} = \\frac{4ac}{3b} \\cdot \\frac{2ac^2}{9b^3} = \\frac{8a^2c^3}{27b^4}$。",
  "例2",
  "计算：",
  "(1) $\\frac{ab^2}{6c^2} \\cdot \\frac{-4c}{3a^2b^2}$； (2) $\\left(\\frac{ab}{4c}\\right)^2$。",
  "解",
  "(1) $\\frac{ab^2}{6c^2} \\cdot \\frac{-4c}{3a^2b^2} = - \\frac{ab^2 \\cdot 4c}{6c^2 \\cdot 3a^2b^2} = - \\frac{2}{9ac}$；",
  "(2) $\\left(\\frac{ab}{4c}\\right)^2 = \\frac{ab}{4c} \\cdot \\frac{ab}{4c} = \\frac{ab \\cdot ab}{4c \\cdot 4c} = \\frac{a^2b^2}{16c^2}$。",
  "可以发现",
  "$\\left(\\frac{b}{a}\\right)^2 = \\frac{b^2}{a^2}$。",
  "例3",
  "计算：",
  "(1) $\\frac{y^2}{6x} \\div \\frac{1}{3x^2}$；",
  "(2) $\\frac{a^2-6a+9}{1+4a+4a^2} \\div \\frac{12-4a}{2a+1}$。",
  "解",
  "(1) $\\frac{y^2}{6x} \\div \\frac{1}{3x^2} = \\frac{y^2}{6x} \\cdot \\frac{3x^2}{1} = \\frac{xy^2}{2}$；",
  "(2) $\\begin{aligned}\\frac{a^2-6a+9}{1+4a+4a^2} \\div \\frac{12-4a}{2a+1} &= \\frac{(a-3)^2}{(2a+1)^2} \\cdot \\frac{2a+1}{-4(a-3)} \\\\ &= -\\frac{a-3}{4(2a+1)}\\end{aligned}$。",
  "进行分式乘除运算时，可以先分解因式，便于约分。",
  "练习",
  "1. 计算：",
  "(1) $2ab^3 \\cdot \\frac{-3a}{2b^3}$；",
  "(2) $\\frac{3}{x^3} \\div \\frac{9}{x^2}$；",
  "(3) $\\frac{a^2-4b^2}{4ab^2} \\cdot \\frac{ab}{a+2b}$；",
  "(4) $\\frac{a^2-b^2}{2ab} \\div (a-b)$。",
  "2. 计算：",
  "(1) $(a-4) \\cdot \\frac{16-a^2}{a^2-8a+16}$；",
  "(2) $\\frac{a^2-a+\\frac{1}{4}}{a-3} \\div \\frac{2a-1}{a^2-3a}$。",
  "分式的混合运算",
  "讨论",
  "怎样计算 $a \\div b \\cdot \\frac{1}{b}$？小明、小丽谁的算法正确？请说明理由。",
  "小明：$a \\div b \\cdot \\frac{1}{b} =a \\div 1=a$。",
  "小丽：$a \\div b \\cdot \\frac{1}{b} =a \\cdot \\frac{1}{b} \\cdot \\frac{1}{b} = \\frac{a}{b^2}$。",
  "与分数的乘除混合运算类似，分式的乘除混合运算，要按从左到右的顺序进行．",
  "例4",
  "求值：$\\frac{a^2+ab-ac}{a^2-ab} \\cdot \\frac{a-b-c}{2ab+a^2+b^2} \\div \\frac{a+b-c}{a^2-b^2}$，其中 $a=25$，$b=5$，$c=-10$．",
  "解",
  "$$",
  "\\begin{align*}",
  "&\\frac{a^2+ab-ac}{a^2-ab} \\cdot \\frac{a-b-c}{2ab+a^2+b^2} \\div \\frac{a+b-c}{a^2-b^2}\\\\",
  "=&\\frac{a^2+ab-ac}{a^2-ab} \\cdot \\frac{a-b-c}{2ab+a^2+b^2} \\cdot \\frac{a^2-b^2}{a+b-c}\\\\",
  "=&\\frac{a(a+b-c)}{a(a-b)} \\cdot \\frac{a-b-c}{(a+b)^2} \\cdot \\frac{(a+b)(a-b)}{a+b-c}\\\\",
  "=&\\frac{a-b-c}{a+b} \\cdot",
  "\\end{align*}",
  "$$",
  "当 $a=25$，$b=5$，$c=-10$ 时，原式$=\\frac{25-5-(-10)}{25+5}=1$．",
  "与分数混合运算类似，分式的加、减、乘、除混合运算的顺序是：先乘除，后加减，如果有括号，先进行括号内的运算．",
  "例5",
  "计算：$1-\\frac{a-2}{a} \\div \\frac{a^2-4}{a^2+a}$．",
  "解",
  "$$",
  "\\begin{align*}",
  "&1-\\frac{a-2}{a} \\div \\frac{a^2-4}{a^2+a}\\\\",
  "=&1-\\frac{a-2}{a} \\cdot \\frac{a^2+a}{a^2-4}\\\\",
  "=&1-\\frac{a-2}{a} \\cdot \\frac{a(a+1)}{(a+2)(a-2)}\\\\",
  "=&1-\\frac{a+1}{a+2}\\\\",
  "=&\\frac{(a+2)-(a+1)}{a+2}\\\\",
  "=&\\frac{1}{a+2} \\cdot",
  "\\end{align*}",
  "$$",
  "例6",
  "已知$x^2+\\frac{1}{x^2}=2$，求$x+\\frac{1}{x}$的值。",
  "解",
  "因为$\\left(x+\\frac{1}{x}\\right)^2=x^2+2\\cdot x\\cdot \\frac{1}{x}+\\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right)^2$",
  "$=x^2+2+\\frac{1}{x^2}$",
  "$=2+2=4$，",
  "所以$x+\\frac{1}{x}=\\pm\\sqrt{4}=\\pm2$。",
  "探究",
  "已知$x+\\frac{1}{x}=2$，如何求$x^2+\\frac{1}{x^2}$的值？",
  "练习",
  "1. 计算：",
  "(1) $\\left(1+\\frac{1}{a-1}\\right)\\left(\\frac{1}{a^2}-1\\right)$；",
  "(2) $\\frac{a-2}{a^2}\\div\\left(1-\\frac{2}{a}\\right)$；",
  "(3) $\\left(\\frac{x+2}{x^2-2x}-\\frac{x-1}{x^2-4x+4}\\right)\\div\\frac{x-4}{x}$；",
  "(4) $\\frac{1}{x-1}-\\frac{x-3}{x^2-1}\\cdot\\frac{x^2+2x+1}{x^2-6x+9}$。",
  "2. 已知$\\frac{1}{a}-\\frac{1}{b}=2$，求$\\frac{a+ab-b}{ab}$的值。",
  "习题",
  "1. 计算：",
  "(1) $\\frac{a^2}{b^2c}\\cdot\\left(-\\frac{bc^2}{2a}\\right)$；",
  "(2) $\\frac{2a-b}{a+b}\\div(b-2a)$；",
  "(3) $\\frac{5x+2}{25-10x+x^2} \\cdot \\frac{x^2-25}{25x^2-4}$；",
  "(4) $\\frac{2x-6}{4-4x+x^2} \\div \\frac{3-x}{(x-2)(x+3)}$．",
  "2. 计算：",
  "(1) $\\frac{-3a}{b} \\cdot \\frac{ab^2}{-a^3b^2} \\div \\left(-\\frac{6b}{a^2}\\right)$；",
  "(2) $-\\frac{a^2-25}{a^2+10a+25} \\div \\frac{a^2-1}{a+5} \\cdot \\frac{a^2+2a+1}{a-5}$．",
  "3. 计算：",
  "(1) $\\frac{x-3}{x-2} \\div \\left(x+2-\\frac{5}{x-2}\\right)$；",
  "(2) $1-\\frac{a-b}{a-2b} \\div \\frac{a^2-b^2}{a^2-4ab+4b^2}$．",
  "4. 求值：",
  "(1) $\\frac{1}{x-1}+\\frac{x^2-3x}{x^2-1}$，其中$x=\\frac{1}{2}$；",
  "(2) $1-\\frac{(x^2-x+1)^2}{(x-1)^2} \\div \\frac{x^2-x+1}{x^2-2x+1}$，其中$x=-\\frac{1}{3}$；",
  "(3) $\\frac{2-x}{x^2+x} \\div \\frac{x^2-3x}{x^2+2x+1} \\cdot \\frac{9-x^2}{4-2x}$，其中$x=-2$．",
  "5. 如图，一并联电路中有两个电阻$R_1$，$R_2$，总电阻为$R$，三者关系为：$\\frac{1}{R}=\\frac{1}{R_1}+\\frac{1}{R_2}$．若已知$R_1$，$R_2$，求$R$．",
  "（第5题）",
  "6. 分别在下列条件下，判断$\\frac{1}{a}$与$\\frac{1}{a^2}$的大小关系，并说明理由．",
  "(1) $a>1$；",
  "(2) $0<a<1$．"
 ],
